&& A paired goal/risk diagram using De Morgan's rule.
layout up
Goal @1,0 = /G/
Negated @4,0 = /!G/
G1 @0,1 = /G1/
G2 @2,1 = /G2/
NotG1 @3,1 = /!G1/
NotG2 @5,1 = /!G2/

G1, G2 __> Goal [o]
NotG1 __> Negated [o]
NotG2 __> Negated [o]
Negated --> Goal [bar]
NotG1 --> G1 [bar] via bottom
NotG2 --> G2 [bar] via bottom
